      "costUsd": 0.006553,
      "pronunciationText": "Last video ended here. This snapper is forty-five centimetres, five above the average snapper off this jetty. This golden perch is forty centimetres, four above the average perch in its river. Five looks bigger than four. But snapper here vary by about four centimetres, and these perch by only about two and a half, so the raw gaps can't be compared. We need a common ruler. Then we'll find the area beyond each catch."
    },
