      "pronunciationText": "For a middle, use symmetry again. Bolts are normal, with mean fifty millimetres and standard deviation zero point three, and pass between forty-nine point five and fifty point five. Zed is plus or minus one point six seven, so each tail is one minus zero point nine five two five, which is zero point zero four seven five. The middle is one minus both tails, about zero point nine zero five. So about ninety point five percent of bolts pass."
