      "pronunciationText": "Zed scores also support judgements. A quality check finds a bottle holding four seventy-four millilitres. Its zed score is minus twenty-six over eight, which is minus three point two five. The table gives zero point nine nine nine four at three point two five, so the tail below is about zero point zero zero zero six. If the machine is still working as modelled, only about six bottles in ten thousand would be that low. So finding one is a good reason to check the machine."
